{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14105390","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14105390","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1410539001:1":{"text":"咦？这是什么魔法？为什么叶子被卷起来了？","source_cn":"咦？这是什么魔法？为什么叶子被卷起来了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9E0EF32FE45DA69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410539002:0":{"text":"这是风，是自然的力量，不是魔法。","source_cn":"这是风，是自然的力量，不是魔法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDF181E3C9E33FF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410539003:1":{"text":"地表一点也不危险，这里又温暖又安定……和女王陛下的教导不一样。","source_cn":"地表一点也不危险，这里又温暖又安定……和女王陛下的教导...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F95286D8EC3807E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410539004:0":{"text":"也就是说……其他的记载也可能是错的？","source_cn":"也就是说……其他的记载也可能是错的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51424570B890951E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410539005:1":{"text":"不行，我得仔细感受地面的一切！我要把真相带回去告诉大家！","source_cn":"不行，我得仔细感受地面的一切！我要把真相带回去告诉大家！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AA4F76284071970","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title